{{!-- context: recipientName, platformName, providerName, actionUrl (optional) --}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">Hi {{recipientName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">
  Reconnect your {{providerName}} 🔗
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Your <strong>{{providerName}}</strong> connection on <strong>{{platformName}}</strong> has stopped working — usually because you changed your {{providerName}} password, or the access was reset for security.
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff7ed;border:2px solid #111827;border-radius:12px;">
  <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;">What this means ⚠️</p>
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151;">Until you reconnect, your profile can't refresh your {{providerName}} stats (followers, reach and reels) for brands.</p>
</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Reconnecting only takes a few seconds — no re-setup needed.
</p>
{{#if actionUrl}}
<div style="margin:0 0 24px;">
  {{> actionButton url=actionUrl label="Reconnect now →"}}
</div>
{{/if}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;">
  If you didn't change anything, this can still happen from time to time — just reconnect and you're all set.
</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">— The {{platformName}} team</p>
